WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.659
Identify safe people and services that can help when rights are violated

00:00:05.533 --> 00:00:10.745
Human right: a basic freedom or protection due to every person. Right to education:

00:00:10.745 --> 00:00:12.979
the opportunity to learn and develop.

00:00:13.783 --> 00:00:18.955
Protection: being kept safe from abuse and harmful treatment. Fairness: treating

00:00:18.955 --> 00:00:23.657
people justly without discrimination. Reporting: telling a trusted adult or

00:00:23.657 --> 00:00:25.538
responsible service about abuse.

00:00:26.367 --> 00:00:30.911
Make an awareness card: one right, one responsibility, and a safe source of help.
